'''Abyssal Stages''' (アビスステージ, ''Abisu Sutēji'', '''Abyss Stages''') are a type of stage introduced in [[Version 15.1 Update|Version 15.1]].

After clearing certain [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stages]] (unknown whether there are any other requirements), the upper-left corner of their button in [[Legend Stages]] will change, seemingly decaying or crumbling to expose a portion of a darker button underneath. Tapping on the button will show a Crown difficulty selection with the Abyssal Stage as a "negative Crown" listed before 1 Crown, the original stage.

Each Abyssal Stage has 5 rewards (1 awarded per clear), which can be viewed in the stage selection screen like [[Timed Score Reward]]s, in addition to the [[Cat Units]] normally dropped from these Advents. Once all rewards have been claimed, a message will appear to notify you that there are none left. After each clear, all units used become "Exhausted" and can no longer be used, similar to [[Underground Labyrinth]]. You can recover exhausted units in case of mistakes at the cost of reducing the stage's clear count by 1. You do not need a full lineup for each clear.

After 10 clears of the same Abyssal Stage, units will be usable in a different series of future attempts as long as you do not choose to recover Exhausted units.

