==List of stages with Abyssal mode==
Only the original versions of each [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] can be played as Abyssal Stages. Alternate versions such as [[Catamin Stages]] and [[:Category:Advent Stages#Sequential Advent Stages|Sequential Advent Stages]] like [[The Angel & The Demon]] are ineligible.
*[[Clionel Ascendant]]
*[[River Styx]]
*[[Queen's Coronation]]
*[[Dead on Debut]]
*[[King Wahwah's Revenge]]
*[[Deeply Dreaming]]
*[[Blue Impact]]
*[[Bottom of the Swamp]]
*[[Prelude to Ruin]]
*[[Temptation's Symphony]]
*[[Rashomon]]

