==Trivia==
*Abyssal Stages' name, unit-trapping mechanic and Dark [[Catseye]] rewards are similar to [[Underground Labyrinth|The Grand Deep]], whose Japanese name is the Grand Abyss (グランドアビス ''Gurando Abisu'').
